sequenceDiagram
    actor Atendente
    actor Mecanico
    participant App as API NestJS (Repo 4)
    participant Guard as JwtAuthGuard + RolesGuard
    participant RDS as RDS PostgreSQL (Repo 1)
    participant Hist as ordens_servico_status_historico
    participant Metrics as /metrics (Prometheus)

    Atendente->>App: POST /os { clienteId, veiculoId }<br/>Authorization: Bearer {token ATENDENTE}
    App->>Guard: valida JWT + role ATENDENTE
    Guard-->>App: autorizado
    App->>RDS: INSERT ordem_servico (status=RECEBIDA)
    App->>Hist: INSERT historico (status=RECEBIDA)
    App->>Metrics: oficina_ordens_servico_created_total++
    App-->>Atendente: 201 { id, status: RECEBIDA }

    Mecanico->>App: POST /os/:id/diagnostico<br/>Authorization: Bearer {token MECANICO}
    App->>Guard: valida JWT + role MECANICO
    App->>RDS: UPDATE status=EM_DIAGNOSTICO
    App->>Hist: INSERT historico (status=EM_DIAGNOSTICO)
    Note over Hist,Metrics: duracao do status anterior (RECEBIDA)<br/>observada no histograma
    App->>Metrics: oficina_ordem_servico_status_duration_seconds.observe()
    App-->>Mecanico: 200 { status: EM_DIAGNOSTICO }

    Atendente->>App: POST /os/:id/orcamento
    App->>RDS: UPDATE status=AGUARDANDO_APROVACAO
    App->>Hist: INSERT historico

    Note over Atendente,App: cliente aprova via webhook (fora deste diagrama)
    App->>RDS: UPDATE status=APROVADA
    App->>Hist: INSERT historico

    Mecanico->>App: POST /os/:id/executar
    App->>RDS: UPDATE status=EM_EXECUCAO
    App->>Hist: INSERT historico

    Mecanico->>App: POST /os/:id/finalizar
    App->>RDS: UPDATE status=FINALIZADA, finalizadaEm=now()
    App->>Hist: INSERT historico (status=FINALIZADA)
    App->>Metrics: observa duracao de EM_EXECUCAO
    App-->>Mecanico: 200 { status: FINALIZADA, tempoExecucaoMs }

    Atendente->>App: POST /os/:id/entregar
    App->>RDS: UPDATE status=ENTREGUE
    App->>Hist: INSERT historico (status=ENTREGUE)
    App-->>Atendente: 200 { status: ENTREGUE }
